{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","魔渊之引"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","마력의 심연"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤黑洞持续将敌人向中心吸引并造成伤害，黑洞中心处生命较低的敌人会被直接击败。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","블랙홀을 소환하여 적을 중심으로 끌어당겨 대미지를 입히며, 블랙홀 중심에 있는 HP가 낮은 적은 즉시 처치당한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，召唤中心区域半径为1格的黑洞持续5秒，黑洞每0.25秒对中心区域内的敌人造成16% + 2% ATK伤害，每0.25秒对中心区域外、距离4格以内的敌人造成6% + 1% ATK的伤害，并将所有敌人朝中心区域吸引，敌人距离黑洞中心越近受到的吸引力越大。处于黑洞中心区域的敌人，在当前生命值低于迪尔格雷600% + 20% ATK且生命值比例低于15% + 1%时会被立即击败。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","맵 1칸을 선택하여 중심 구역 반경 1칸의 블랙홀을 5초간 소환한다. 블랙홀은 0.25초마다 중심 구역 내의 적에게 16% + 2% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 0.25초마다 중심 구역 밖과 4칸 범위 내의 적에게 6% + 1% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 또한 모든 적을 중심 구역으로 끌어당기며, 블랙홀 중심과의 거리가 가까울수록 적이 받는 흡인력이 증가한다. 블랙홀 중심 구역에 있는 적의 현재 HP가 딜그레이의 600% + 20% ATK 보다 낮으며, HP 비율이 15% + 1% 미만일 경우 즉시 처치당한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":87,"end":92,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":161,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":182,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":68,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":126,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":236,"end":242,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":265,"end":270,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":157,"end":171,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":65,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":119,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":232,"end":246,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至17% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至7% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","블랙홀이 0.25초마다 중심 구역 내의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 17% + 2% ATK로 증가하며, 중심 구역 밖의 적에게 입히는 대미지는 7% + 1% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":79,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至18% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至8% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","블랙홀이 0.25초마다 중심 구역 내의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 18% + 2% ATK로 증가하며, 중심 구역 밖의 적에게 입히는 대미지는 8% + 1% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":79,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至19% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至9% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","블랙홀이 0.25초마다 중심 구역 내의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 19% + 2% ATK로 증가하며, 중심 구역 밖의 적에게 입히는 대미지는 9% + 1% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":79,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至20% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至10% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","블랙홀이 0.25초마다 중심 구역 내의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 20% + 2% ATK로 증가하며, 중심 구역 밖의 적에게 입히는 대미지는 10% + 1% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":51,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":85,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","厄难之灾"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","고난의 재앙"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暗黑法球对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","어둠의 마법구를 소환해 적에게 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤3枚暗黑法球，依次向敌方最密集区域发射对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成65% + 7% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","어둠의 마법구를 3개 소환하여 순서대로 적군이 가장 밀집된 구역에 발사해 주변 1칸 범위 내의 적에게 65% + 7% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":60,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":57,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至70% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 70% + 7% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至75% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 75% + 7% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至80% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 80% + 7% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","巫影魔爪"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","그림자 스매시"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用魔法抓取最近的敌人，并将其砸向敌方最密集区域。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","마법을 사용해 가장 가까운 적을 잡아 적이 가장 밀집된 구역으로 내려친다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用魔法将最靠近自己的1名敌人抓到半空禁锢1秒，随后将其砸向敌方最密集区域并使其倒地0.5秒，对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成150% + 10% ATK伤害。优先选择范围内不处于霸体或稳定状态的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","마법을 사용해 자신과 가장 가까운 적 1명을 붙잡아 공중으로 띄워 1초간 구속하며, 이후 적이 가장 밀집된 구역으로 내려쳐 주변 1칸 범위 내의 적에게 150% + 10% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 0.5초 동안 쓰러뜨린다. 범위 내 제어 면역 또는 안정 상태가 아닌 적을 우선 선택한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":89,"end":95,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":88,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":91,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":85,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":130,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":139,"end":141,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 160% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/